  "title": "FCC’s New Rule Affects Robot Vacuums and Pool Cleaners",
  "summary": "A new restriction on foreign-made mobile robots affects robotic vacuums, pool cleaners, and lawn mowers. This regulation aims to limit competition and increase consumer awareness of the risks associated with these devices.",
