    {
      "statement": "The FCC’s new rule restricts the use of foreign-made mobile robots in certain areas of the United States.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The rule affects robotic vacuums, pool cleaners, and lawn mowers, impacting both existing and potential buyers.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
